      ["open","h1",{}],
      ["text","Backpack-Mounted Third Robot Arm"],
      ["close","h1"],
      ["open","p",{"class":"lead"}],
      ["text","Motion planning and stabilization for COBORG, a wearable robotic arm that assists technicians with overhead panel installation."],
      ["close","p"],
      ["open","div",{"class":"detail-result"}],
      ["open","strong",{}],
      ["text","84.62%"],
      ["close","strong"],
      ["open","span",{}],
      ["text","task success in panel installation tests"],
      ["close","span"],
      ["close","div"],
      ["open","div",{"class":"prose"}],
      ["open","p",{}],
      ["text","COBORG is a backpack-mounted exoskeleton designed to act as an extra hand for overhead manufacturing and assembly. The platform helps an operator support and position panels while reducing the need for a second person."],
      ["close","p"],
      ["open","h2",{}],
      ["text","My contribution"],
      ["close","h2"],
      ["open","ul",{}],
      ["open","li",{}],
      ["text","Led the motion planning subsystem in C++ for a 4-DOF wearable robotic arm."],
      ["close","li"],
      ["open","li",{}],
      ["text","Developed a multi-stage pipeline transitioning from end-effector position control to force control using MoveIt and Octomap in ROS Melodic."],
      ["close","li"],
      ["open","li",{}],
      ["text","Implemented a resolved rate controller to compensate for user motion of up to 6 inches of translation and 90 degrees of rotation."],
      ["close","li"],
      ["close","ul"],
      ["open","h2",{}],
      ["text","Results"],
      ["close","h2"],
      ["open","p",{}],
      ["text","The system achieved an 84.62% task success rate and a 100% safety success rate in panel installation tests with panels weighing up to 15 lbs."],
      ["close","p"],
      ["open","p",{}],
      ["open","a",{"class":"text-link","href":"https://mrsdprojects.ri.cmu.edu/2021teamc/"}],
