      ["text","Multimodal learning · Visual reasoning"],
      ["close","p"],
      ["open","h1",{}],
      ["text","Scene Graphs for Visual Question Answering"],
      ["close","h1"],
      ["open","p",{"class":"lead"}],
      ["text","Generating structured relationships between objects to improve visual question answering when scene graph annotations are missing."],
      ["close","p"],
      ["open","div",{"class":"detail-result"}],
      ["open","strong",{}],
      ["text","11%"],
      ["close","strong"],
      ["open","span",{}],
      ["text","GraphVQA accuracy improvement on scene graph-deficient test sets"],
      ["close","span"],
      ["close","div"],
      ["open","div",{"class":"prose"}],
      ["open","p",{}],
      ["text","This multimodal machine learning class project explored how scene graphs—structured representations of objects and their relationships—can support visual question answering (VQA)."],
      ["close","p"],
      ["open","h2",{}],
      ["text","My contribution"],
      ["close","h2"],
      ["open","p",{}],
      ["text","I designed a scene graph generation pipeline using MotifNet and bottom-up attention networks, then fine-tuned GraphVQA with generated scene graphs. This improved accuracy by 11% on scene graph-deficient test sets."],
      ["close","p"],
      ["open","h2",{}],
      ["text","Research directions"],
      ["close","h2"],
      ["open","ul",{}],
      ["open","li",{}],
      ["open","strong",{}],
      ["text","Fine-grained reasoning:"],
      ["close","strong"],
      ["text","use object-level and relationship information alongside global visual features to help answer questions about a scene."],
      ["close","li"],
      ["open","li",{}],
      ["open","strong",{}],
      ["text","Pre-training:"],
      ["close","strong"],
      ["text","explore masking relationships and object features so models learn to recover missing contextual information."],
      ["close","li"],
      ["open","li",{}],
      ["open","strong",{}],
      ["text","Low-resource datasets:"],
      ["close","strong"],
      ["text","investigate scene graph features for prompt initialization and generate scene graphs where annotations are unavailable."],
      ["close","li"],
      ["close","ul"],
      ["open","p",{}],
      ["open","a",{"class":"text-link","href":"../assets/pdf/gqa.pdf"}],
      ["text","Read the project paper (PDF)"],
      ["close","a"],
