      ["close","p"],
      ["open","h1",{}],
      ["text","CenterPoint Joint Object–Attribute Prediction"],
      ["close","h1"],
      ["open","p",{"class":"lead"}],
      ["text","Extending a LiDAR-based 3D detector to jointly predict objects and attributes, including vehicle type and pedestrian posture."],
      ["close","p"],
      ["open","div",{"class":"detail-result"}],
      ["open","strong",{}],
      ["text","83%"],
      ["close","strong"],
      ["open","span",{}],
      ["text","average precision for vehicle and pedestrian object–attribute pairs"],
      ["close","span"],
      ["close","div"],
      ["open","div",{"class":"prose"}],
      ["open","p",{}],
      ["text","This project extended the CenterPoint 3D detection model to predict object attributes alongside detections in autonomous driving LiDAR data."],
      ["close","p"],
      ["open","h2",{}],
      ["text","My contribution"],
      ["close","h2"],
      ["open","ul",{}],
      ["open","li",{}],
      ["text","Led the design and implementation of joint object and attribute prediction."],
      ["close","li"],
      ["open","li",{}],
      ["text","Managed data processing and augmented the nuScenes dataset with attribute labels."],
      ["close","li"],
      ["open","li",{}],
      ["text","Fine-tuned the model on both detection and attribute prediction objectives."],
      ["close","li"],
      ["close","ul"],
      ["open","h2",{}],
      ["text","Results"],
      ["close","h2"],
      ["open","p",{}],
      ["text","The model achieved 83% average precision for vehicle and pedestrian object–attribute pairs."],
      ["close","p"],
